      "value": "@{5c9e1964fdae3c762882d557|full_name}: I'm not sure if your issue is the same. I think my problems are mostly limited to the game deadlocking with a black screen and not starting up, after EAC window disappears.\n\nOnce the game eventually starts up, it runs mostly fine.\n\nMirrors don't have occlusion culling, so them affecting performance is normal in a complex scene.",
